{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57575","headline":"广成子传附二味 · 无名氏","name":"广成子传附二味","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"要伏离宫亦等闲，搜求坎户取精研。\n但比夫妇成交感，孕出黄芽见本源。\n若不亲传师指受，此外徒劳虚费钱。\n火候仍修终九九，丹成直待是三年。\n（按：广成子爲古神仙，事见《庄子·在宥》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}